{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-seeds-in-the-pits-oware","version":1,"title":"Seeds in the Pits (an oware-style counting rhyme)","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8","9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"We set the pits in two long rows,\nwith seeds to count as the game goes.","sentences":["We set the pits in two long rows,\nwith seeds to count as the game goes."],"alt":"A wooden board with two rows of pits and seeds.","image":{"hash":"sha256:2932a74137ef00ba15359e52dfe6933956a8d49526a8c675d4265c6fe43eb1a3","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:733a38119071c30c996d1c57cf1c389fa7c9b333989ed6fa75ade746753f603e","durationMs":6320,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6320]],"words":[[0,207],[207,518],[518,829],[829,1243],[1243,1450],[1450,1761],[1761,2176],[2176,2849],[2849,3264],[3264,3782],[3782,3989],[3989,4507],[4507,4714],[4714,5025],[5025,5439],[5439,6320]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Take the seeds from one small pit.\nDrop one in each, and count bit by bit.","sentences":["Take the seeds from one small pit.","Drop one in each, and count bit by bit."],"alt":"A child dropping one seed at a time into pits.","image":{"hash":"sha256:cdea2061731e1799f987b8dd58c39816d8931cad760603233cdc2611f2efeecb","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:fc6372c94c6860b707fae46a5ce43ea399631fc8fe20cf68a4d7a9db198ab30c","durationMs":7640,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3565],[3565,7640]],"words":[[0,453],[453,792],[792,1358],[1358,1811],[1811,2151],[2151,2716],[2716,3565],[3565,4018],[4018,4358],[4358,4584],[4584,5320],[5320,5659],[5659,6225],[6225,6565],[6565,6791],[6791,7640]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Think, think, think before you play:\nwhich pit will help you win today?","sentences":["Think, think, think before you play:\nwhich pit will help you win today?"],"alt":"Two children thinking over the board.","image":{"hash":"sha256:71dd946e20685bf95badb1b432